      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this fantastic three-bedroom / three-bathroom duplex apartment in the exclusive The Slade, Tassagard development. Ideally located in the heart of Saggart Village. The Slade is a highly sought-after location based on many factors, the area is well serviced by excellent transport links from numerous bus routes, and the Red Line Luas just a 5-minute walk away. There is a fine selection of schools in a close proximity, as well as all the local amenities you can imagine including shops, eateries and recreational facilities including Rathcoole Park nearby. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 186 sqm consists of entrance hallway with storage room, beautiful fully fitted kitchen, large open plan living/dining area with lovely breakfast area and extra high ceiling space, double bedroom and family bathroom which is fully tiled. On the first floor you have a stunning landing which leads to two master bedrooms with ensuite bathrooms and fitted with top-quality built-in wardrobes. A double door from the living area leads to a low maintenance balcony with a south facing orientation with lovely countryside views. \r\n\r\nNo.12a The Slade is situated in one of Saggart's most sought after developments and comes to the market in turnkey condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years. There is plenty of additional features such as large living space with extra high ceiling, beautifully presented, three double bedrooms, designated parking space with ample visitor parking and top-quality fixtures & fittings to name but a few. \r\n\r\nThis property truly needs to be viewed to appreciate the fantastic home on offer and homes like this rarely come to the market, we expect this to be really popular with a wide range of buyers due to its size and location. Call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n- 186 sqm \r\n- BER B\r\n- 3 bed / 3 bath \r\n- Duplex apartment \r\n- Turnkey condition throughout\r\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings \r\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \r\n- Extra spacious living\r\n- Entrance hallway with ample storage \r\n- Beautiful fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Integrated appliances \r\n- Stunning breakfast island \r\n- Large open plan living/dining area\r\n- Extra high ceiling space \r\n- Stunning feature wall \r\n- Three spacious bedrooms\r\n- Built in wardrobes\r\n- Master ensuite x2\r\n- Main family bathroom fully tiled \r\n- Ample storage \r\n- Top quality flooring \r\n- Designated parking \r\n- Ample visitor parking \r\n- Double glazed PVC windows\r\n- Gas fired central heating \r\n- Private balcony off living room \r\n- Sunny south facing orientation \r\n- Beautiful countryside views \r\n- Family oriented development \r\n- Most sought-after development in Saggart \r\n- MGMT fee c 2,900 per annum\r\n- 20% discount if paid in full before April \r\n- Suitable for a wide range of buyers \r\n- Close to all local amenities \r\n- Viewing is highly advised. \r\n\r\nDirections - Coming off the N7 at the Rathcoole/Saggart junction, take the first exit onto Mill road towards Saggart. Take the first exit at the next roundabout you reach and proceed towards village. At the cross roads turn left for about 200m then turn right into Tassagard and continue straight where number 12a will be in the block down the end straight in front."
      },
